  hintLines:
  - "Wow a hint so soon\u2026 "
  - Well inside this door you will be tasked with finding a key that could help you
  - ' in your unsuccessful attempt to escape'
  - "But I advise you to put on a jacket because inside the weather won\u2019t be
    as nice as I am. "
  - 'You will be sliding across on the icy floor as you navigate temperatures way
    below what your use to. '
  - "Have fun and come back for another hint when you fail\u2026 again"
